				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obsan_deal_216a" title="발행어음 매도 주문" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="335" _ulen="251" >

ODER_DATE^주문일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
PWD^비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0
